{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2014-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1394236800, "end_date": 1394927999, "month_true_total": 589, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:01:52 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "9493106", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036410353", "personaname": "Eric U.", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198036410353/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1265, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1089, "last_played": 1422153903, "avatar": "4ecfc9ae51e583c68eb10da63bd6c7e3002799a5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome war simulator!! Multiplayer is the best when you are on a server with a group of people that want to play seriously, if not it can be a bummer.  Single player is fun as well as it can become more of a FPS  than a simulator.  I call this game a simulator over FPS because if you try to play it as a point and shoot game you will die in the first 10 minutes.  Highly recomend!!!", "timestamp_created": 1394922814, "timestamp_updated": 1394922814, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9492790", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008103303", "personaname": "A Ton Of Spiders In A SWAT Suit", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ThatTharNewBlood/", "num_games_owned": 379, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 419576, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17414, "last_played": 1785037851, "avatar": "c9765486b94773f91d623820edff647a43044ee2"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's good as all get out.", "timestamp_created": 1394921162, "timestamp_updated": 1699135670, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.500324487686157227", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9492719", "author": {"steamid": "76561198085479195", "personaname": "st0vep1pe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/st0vep1pe/", "num_games_owned": 719, "num_reviews": 131, "playtime_forever": 19249, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9900, "last_played": 1590277986, "avatar": "66678e08712d0e388bcb230ed6a37d0d0538d2d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is a massive improvement to the series. Both the visuals and the gameplay have received a complete makeover, while still being very recognisable to anyone familiar with the ArmA series. \n\nEspecially CQB is more fun now, with the reworked controls, stances and ballistics (barrier penetration). Vehicles also received some attention, now with realstic physics. Another nice addition is the underwater gameplay, it adds a whole new dimension to the game.\n\nContrary to its predecessors, the campaign has a very good storyline and is more immersive.", "timestamp_created": 1394920805, "timestamp_updated": 1575034320, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9491697", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058121836", "personaname": "OrcaMortal", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Enmorales12/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4668, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1513, "last_played": 1553368534, "avatar": "92a6be785e961bc90515b4fc07b9c1835970338f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really like the realism of the game. The controls are difficult to learn but once you get used to it you will like the game.", "timestamp_created": 1394912061, "timestamp_updated": 1394912061, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9490047", "author": {"steamid": "76561198012755018", "personaname": "Jimi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kapu1234/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 915, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 803, "last_played": 1401383960, "avatar": "3004f160a19f7d6cdbb7b2c0ebd0a3b2b21f55aa"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pile of ♥♥♥♥, biggest waste of money ever. It should be illegal to sell a game as broken as this for 45 mother ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ euros. 5/5", "timestamp_created": 1394903491, "timestamp_updated": 1394903491, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}